page('team','Meet Team Basma',hero('The Agent4Life team','Personal attention.<br>A shared standard.','Meet the people behind the name, and connect directly with the agent you want to work with.')+'<section class="wrap people">'+''.join(f'<article id="{slug}">{picture("assets/img/team-"+slug+".jpg",name)}<div><p class="kicker">{role}</p><h2>{name}</h2><p>{bio}</p><div class="person-contact"><a href="tel:+1{phone}">{phone[:3]}.{phone[3:6]}.{phone[6:]}</a><a href="mailto:{email}">{email}</a></div></div></article>' for slug,name,role,bio,phone,email in team)+'</section>'+cta())
quotes=[('Sume Aktar','Great team , great agent for buy and sell houses. Really worked hard for us even though it was a national holiday’s. Appreciated everything specially Emad.'),('Angelina Lopez Luviano','Emad is great! You can trust him! Helped us with selling a property. He is available for you at all times, quick to answer. He communicates every step of the process. I 100% recommend him.'),('Karen','Agent4Life Realty does amazing work!! I have both purchased and sold with them. They are extremely knowledgeable, trustworthy and committed. They made the process seamless and updated you every step of the way.'),('Danielle Faasisila','Emad made the house buying process so easy! He has excellent communication and helped us get a great deal! We highly recommend using him as your realtor!!'),('Mai Lam','Emad and his team have really taken care of us throughout the years. He has helped us sell our home and just got us into our forever home. Such an honest and professional team and I recommend to all my family, friends and neighbors.'),('Fam Del Carpio','Great Realtor, amazing team!')]
